    "pricing.cancelA": ["可以，通过 Paddle 收据中的客户门户取消；权益保留至已付费周期结束。", "Yes. Cancel through the customer portal in your Paddle receipt; access continues until the paid period ends.", "Có. Hủy qua cổng khách hàng trong biên nhận Paddle; quyền truy cập còn đến hết kỳ đã trả phí.", "ได้ ยกเลิกผ่านพอร์ทัลลูกค้าในใบเสร็จ Paddle และใช้สิทธิ์ต่อได้จนสิ้นสุดรอบที่ชำระแล้ว", "Ya. Batalkan melalui portal pelanggan pada tanda terima Paddle; akses tetap berlaku hingga periode berbayar berakhir."],
