    "pricing.methodsA": ["由 Paddle 处理付款，支持银行卡、PayPal 等，具体方式取决于所在地区及结账页面。", "Paddle handles payments, including cards, PayPal and other methods depending on your region and checkout availability.", "Paddle xử lý thanh toán bằng thẻ, PayPal và các phương thức khác tùy khu vực và trang thanh toán.", "Paddle จัดการชำระเงินด้วยบัตร PayPal และวิธีอื่นตามภูมิภาคและตัวเลือกที่แสดงตอนชำระเงิน", "Paddle menangani pembayaran dengan kartu, PayPal dan metode lain sesuai wilayah dan ketersediaan saat checkout."],
